:: e1 [map]
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <div class='explore-box'>
    <h3>EXPLORE</h3>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Go to the Wave School->e1: wave school]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <<map 'e1'>><<s>><</map>><<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition = 'e1'>>
</div>

:: e1: wave school [blue-urf]
<<if !$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.includes('paddle')>>
<p>A large group of people seems to be standing in line, waiting to get in.</p>
<p>Thankfully, you don't have to wait long before a figure steps out of the building and addresses the crowd.</p>
<<rhia>>Hello, everyone.
<<cont keypress append>>I know that many of you are here to complete your Wave School challenge.
<<cont keypress append>>Unfortunately, I am going to have to close the school until further notice.
<<cont keypress>><<replace '#response-1'>><<link 'Good grief. Not this again.' 'e2: wave school closed'>><</link>><</replace>><</cont>>
<</cont>><</cont>><</rhia>>
<span id='response-1'></span>
<<else>>
You've already done this challenge!
<</if>>

:: e2: wave school closed
<p>First Veil School and now this?!</p>
<p>How are you supposed to complete the Mergimal Challenge if all the schools keep closing?</p>
<p>You decide to go talk to Rhia to see what is going on.</p>
<span id='response-1'><<link 'What is going on?'>><<replace '#response-1'>><<say $activePlayer $player.image>>What is going on?<</say>><</replace>><</link>></span>

